    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Odiechieng Jehova Nyasaye",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jehova Nyasaye Maratego wacho niya, \"Adier odiechiengʼ biro manoliel ka mach mar kendo maliet. Joma timbegi mono kod joma timbegi richo nomokgo mach. Odiechiengno nobolgi e mach mi gundgi norum chuth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To un muluoro nyinga, tekona nopilre kuomu ka wangʼ chiengʼ makelo ler mi changu gi bwombene. Kendo unuwuog oko ka ulengʼoru gi ilo ka nyiroye moyawnegi dho abila.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bangʼe ununyon joma timbegi richo piny; kendo ginibed buru e bwo tiendu odiechiengʼ ma anatimie gigi,\" Jehova Nyasaye Maratego owacho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Paruru chik mar jatichna Musa, buchena gi chikena mane amiye e got mar Horeb ne jo-Israel duto.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Neuru, anaornu janabi Elija kapod odiechiengʼ maduongʼ kendo malich mar Jehova Nyasaye obiro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enoduog chunje wuone ir nyithindgi, kendo chunje nyithindo ir wuonegi; nono to anabi kendo aketh piny gi kwongʼ!\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
